@prefix cardle: <https://cardle.example/ontology/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<https://cardle.example/ontology>
    a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Cardle Ontology"@en .

### Classes

cardle:Manufacturer a owl:Class .
cardle:Model a owl:Class .
cardle:Variant a owl:Class .
cardle:Version a owl:Class .

cardle:Engine a owl:Class .
cardle:BodyStyle a owl:Class .
cardle:Drivetrain a owl:Class .
cardle:VehicleClass a owl:Class .
cardle:CylinderArrangement a owl:Class .
cardle:Source a owl:Class .

### Object properties

cardle:hasModel a owl:ObjectProperty .
cardle:hasVariant a owl:ObjectProperty .
cardle:hasVersion a owl:ObjectProperty .

cardle:hasEngine a owl:ObjectProperty .
cardle:hasBodyStyle a owl:ObjectProperty .
cardle:hasDrivetrain a owl:ObjectProperty .
cardle:hasVehicleClass a owl:ObjectProperty .
cardle:hasCylinderArrangement a owl:ObjectProperty .
cardle:assertedFrom a owl:ObjectProperty .

### Datatype properties

cardle:cylinderCount a owl:DatatypeProperty .
cardle:sourceUrl a owl:DatatypeProperty .